{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"量子群"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"量子群"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>量子群是某些 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hopf代数","text":"Hopf 代数"}},{"Plain":"的别称. 其模范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"辫幺半范畴","text":"辫幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>重要的例子是 Drinfeld, Jimbo 引入的 $U_q(\\mathfrak g)$, 即复半单 Lie 代数的"},{"Local":{"url":"泛包络代数","text":"泛包络代数"}},{"Plain":"的形变.</p>\n"}]}}